# Client-facing communication

When drafting PR descriptions, commit messages, or handoff notes:

- Lead with user-visible outcome, not toolchain details
- Call out risk (auth, payments, data loss) explicitly
- Include a short manual test checklist
- Never mention internal QA persona IDs or seed-account emails in customer-facing copy
